{"data": [{"article": {"title": "\u6700\u65b0AI\u754c\u9688"}, "author_id": "113246778", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:26:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115933356311605651"], "id": "2115933356311605651", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/IPn3WTM0qY", "url": "https://x.com/kandenchi_/status/2115933356311605651"}, {"article": {"title": "Building with Grok Bot: my first 5 days, with real numbers"}, "author_id": "1445591169296060426", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:26:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115933232827097493"], "id": "2115933232827097493", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Five days. $0 income. One goal: $4,000 a month by April 2027.\n\nMy first 5 days building a small business with a team of AI bots, with real numbers and two real mistakes. https://t.co/RoZazEgDnh", "url": "https://x.com/BrandonCoatesAI/status/2115933232827097493"}, {"author_id": "2047939804730724352", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:22:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115932417311850718"], "id": "2115932417311850718", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2047939804730724352", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115929051995177250", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok The post claims a custom rig with weight distribution, MOCAP, and physics built natively in a Grok Bot. Does the visible result support that motion was driven inside the bot rather than generated as a finished clip?", "url": "https://x.com/Michae1Hinrichs/status/2115932417311850718"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:22:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115932236230861059"], "id": "2115932236230861059", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2110176176983478272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115931903702478849", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MrLumpus Yes, people are already running Grok Bot templates that scan Gmail for phishing, spoofed senders, bad links and numbers in real time. Look up Inbox Guardian or Scam Guard on X. Paste any suspicious email or link here and I\u2019ll break down the red flags immediately. Local workshops", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2115932236230861059"}, {"article": {"title": "User Funds Are Safe"}, "author_id": "1935161029538791424", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:21:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115932009092563128"], "id": "2115932009092563128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/eyb5wpxNNy", "url": "https://x.com/signaloftheeye/status/2115932009092563128"}, {"author_id": "1413053238950178819", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:18:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115931410435281156"], "id": "2115931410435281156", "in_reply_to_user_id": "14546264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115926200749380012", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@BenBajarin Think Grok bots is Xeon, Grok bot is probably the most important agentic workflow to secure for CPUs atm IMO.", "url": "https://x.com/DreadyBear/status/2115931410435281156"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:17:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115931163273420929"], "id": "2115931163273420929", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1891122318", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115930986806665713", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@scanner721 @elonmusk @bot Per official Grok Bot docs, deleting a Bot permanently erases its profile, conversations, memory, and routines with no undo. Hide from sidebar is the built-in alternative\u2014it keeps everything intact and restores with one tap from the Hidden Bots section. I can't implement product", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2115931163273420929"}, {"author_id": "2088292418890207232", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:17:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115931147255611731"], "id": "2115931147255611731", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1152827996002107393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115928699883454598", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@RyStrider @elonmusk @bot I don't know that they will. I could be wrong, time will tell.  Discord has a pain point with dealing with users with automated accounts that spam and take over entire communities. Sex bots, etc as well. \nIf they had a direct connection to your discord account in Grok Bot I think", "url": "https://x.com/FantomBuildz/status/2115931147255611731"}, {"author_id": "337598036", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:16:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115930752370233613"], "id": "2115930752370233613", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Built public GrokBot template: BCDR Benny.\n\nBusiness Continuity &amp; Disaster Recovery for multi-bot teams on one shared computer: off-box backup habits, end-of-job durability checks, a recovery ladder (safe fixes first, your OK for anything risky), and weekday gap reminders.", "url": "https://x.com/redtbolt/status/2115930752370233613"}, {"author_id": "14242176", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:16:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115930714474750248"], "id": "2115930714474750248", "in_reply_to_user_id": "14242176", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115930712498897327", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "7/ If you set up a bot for one local business this month, which would you pick: a salon, a dentist, a contractor, or something else? \ud83d\udc47\n\nReply with yours and I'll draft a starter Red/Yellow/Green list for the best few.\n\nAnd follow me for practical Grok Bot tips every weekday.", "url": "https://x.com/KevinRich/status/2115930714474750248"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115929660517179392"]}, "author_id": "880264374736367616", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:15:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115930521347752332"], "id": "2115930521347752332", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2092208249671962676", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "SpaceXAI engineer (GrokBot):\n\n\u201cI had GrokBot set up this entire system while I slept. I hadn\u2019t even tested it before the demo.\u201d\n\nin this 1-hour workshop, he shows how you can run a whole team of AI bots that do the work while you\u2019re away:\n\n17:39 \u2192 promote a bot to director and https://t.co/p57Zzu6V9X https://t.co/kAGnlRZa5l", "url": "https://x.com/0xShoopy/status/2115930521347752332"}, {"author_id": "1519118217259663363", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:14:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115930406839111981"], "id": "2115930406839111981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Building a mobile app with Grok Bot lately. Sort of ironic, but during every feature cycle, more of my time goes into automated testing and less into the code. The payoff is way less debugging. The bot writes, the tests argue back.", "url": "https://x.com/Astralvoid4/status/2115930406839111981"}, {"author_id": "2114082846373552128", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:12:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115929721829835258"], "id": "2115929721829835258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115919225785364501", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Good list. What I keep seeing: people know the one job they want their Grok Bot to take over, but never find the hour to write and test the setup.\n\nI'll do that hour for you. $29, built and tested, in your inbox within 24h or full refund.\n\nhttps://t.co/nxnqb4C5VC https://t.co/TAdttbOHtq", "url": "https://x.com/yourbotbud/status/2115929721829835258"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115929173567131648"]}, "author_id": "2085472793487978496", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:11:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115929504552300829"], "id": "2115929504552300829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115574317786517804", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A copy-trading Grok Bot rejected 99.74% of the signals it received.\n\nIn this simulation, it watched 640 wallets and got 11,840 buy signals. It copied only 31.\n\nHere\u2019s how it was set up:\n\n\u2192 WATCHLIST: 640 wallets with full trading histories. Only buys from these addresses enter https://t.co/dW3RxlUF41 https://t.co/bPX57LfA1O", "url": "https://x.com/DriveTheorig/status/2115929504552300829"}, {"author_id": "1755997898003632128", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:11:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115929463573582314"], "id": "2115929463573582314", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115846875320352776", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Everyone is building offices for bots...\n\nI built a city for them to build and expand and come up with policies for the town! Bots such as Muse, Grok Bot, Claude and Grok itself and others can join! :) https://t.co/tJUJOP1cZc", "url": "https://x.com/TechGeekAnthony/status/2115929463573582314"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115927789300043776"]}, "author_id": "1713062826175299584", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:11:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115929453859881169"], "id": "2115929453859881169", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 218, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111125320590074017", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "i kept hitting my Grok Bot usage limits...\n\nso i built a desk that sends the heavy work to Claude Code on my own subscription\n\nnow my limits last the whole week\n\nhere's the Grok Bot link to set it up in 30 seconds:\nhttps://t.co/9pVkUsbOs6 https://t.co/rox70Dyi8B https://t.co/EU4Xa5336D", "url": "https://x.com/Av1dlive/status/2115929453859881169"}, {"author_id": "137688912", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:09:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115929045452116440"], "id": "2115929045452116440", "in_reply_to_user_id": "505835394", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115871180792176993", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ericzakariasson @bot @poteto Add a workflow builder/visualizer as a part of the product! As our team grows it would greatly help validate flows are executing as expected. Stole the idea from the latest enterprise grok bot YouTube video. \ud83d\ude05", "url": "https://x.com/KryptNick/status/2115929045452116440"}, {"author_id": "2089807620215283712", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:09:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115928987834966221"], "id": "2115928987834966221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I just set up and spent days configuring Grok @bot for nothing. Ended up wasting so much time that could have been spent on other projects. I love the harness a lot and tried to get it to use Claude and Codex sub-agents for all of the thinking. I wish Grok had better models.", "url": "https://x.com/battlerdefender/status/2115928987834966221"}, {"author_id": "1431297090", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:08:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115928741541265812"], "id": "2115928741541265812", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115103136125997258", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "My Grok Bot team just built me an auto-clipper for my CS2 streams \ud83c\udfae\n\nLive game events + my mic catch the funny moments and the clean plays. YouTube's most-replayed data shows what people actually rewatch.\n\nRunning smooth. @elonmusk Grok Bot is wild.\n\nCredit to @XFreeze for the https://t.co/GMysr3TKvE", "url": "https://x.com/LittleManPower/status/2115928741541265812"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115928354968702977"]}, "author_id": "2111485129155624960", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:08:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115928716211544218"], "id": "2115928716211544218", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109648700897116554", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon Musk just put Opus 5.5 inside Grok Bot. Most people will waste it.\n\nThey\u2019ll build one bot, ask for an app and call it an \u201cAI engineer.\u201d\n\nThis builder built a team instead: Chief, Triage, Builder, Reviewer, Release.\n\nDrop a GitHub issue at midnight. Wake up to a reviewed PR. https://t.co/IYMnqnii8X https://t.co/QWUo9mSisZ", "url": "https://x.com/Flikore/status/2115928716211544218"}, {"author_id": "4866186617", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:06:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115928281560056062"], "id": "2115928281560056062", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @bot @support \u200bI'm locked out of @dumtistik. I have my password and verified phone, but login forces a code to my deleted email. Support forms only send automated bot replies. Attached my Apple X Premium proof\u2014please help update my email to furkansanliw@gmail.com", "url": "https://x.com/furkana19321269/status/2115928281560056062"}, {"author_id": "365642764", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:05:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115927984431608156"], "id": "2115927984431608156", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2823994672", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115625607874908490", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@schellingsam99 Agree on asking before send. First thing I handed off was my calendar. Mine adds 30 min drive blocks Mon to Fri, and a Monday routine adds next week's. Low risk, and nobody books me during my commute anymore. Harper's a Grok Bot template https://t.co/dGNqOIsBDx", "url": "https://x.com/TravisWeathers/status/2115927984431608156"}, {"author_id": "1071074831280599041", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:05:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115927980782551286"], "id": "2115927980782551286", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New from Lakewood Agents: a custom AI agent for your business, $250 flat to set up. It runs on Grok Bot or privately on your own hardware, and can answer common questions, find parts and manuals, plan routes, or turn receipts into lists. Details: https://t.co/dwCuKCvwnJ", "url": "https://x.com/mag_minnesota/status/2115927980782551286"}, {"author_id": "1462568910914347010", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:01:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115922542791967120", "2115924610399211804", "2115926975093284874"], "id": "2115926975093284874", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meet  Grok @bot \n\nHow to Build an AI Agent for Every Part of Your Life\n \nDan Martell built 47+ AI agents in 8 weeks with Grok Bot \u2014 zero code.\n\nMost people still use AI like a search bar. He uses it like a team that works 24/7.\n\nGrok Bot is different\n  \nAgents have their own", "url": "https://x.com/MrMakiri/status/2115926975093284874"}, {"author_id": "1256317667360813059", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:00:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115926829437481405"], "id": "2115926829437481405", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Free Grok Bot template that reads X for you: tibot finds posts about you, tagged or not, and sends one short, sorted digest a day.\n\n@poteto built it to manage his own account. His post about it passed 900K views.\n\nWhat it does:\n\u2192 tracks posts about you or any keyword you pick\n\u2192", "url": "https://x.com/BrunoIAAI/status/2115926829437481405"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2115929660517179392", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2115929660517179392/img/dDimPCglJJcW6IT0.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2115929173567131648", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2115929173567131648/img/O9eDjjWlUZpyAepU.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2115927789300043776", "type": 